    "body": "Quick pass (M5): the root cause is a frame-order bug (the shell cleared `geo_hover` before the viewport drew), fixed by a one-frame carry (`geo_hover_drawn`) plus a repaint on change. Ephemeral `State`, no command. A strong distinct hover style (magenta over a dark halo, its own `Overlay::RowHover` ink in both themes). Pins: hover/draw handoff for face, chain and vertex rows, label and remove button; the style test; mutations red, with one disclosed survivor (`geo_hover` vs `geo_hover_drawn`, indistinguishable after a frame). Reverse hover filed as #1519. The quick gate, ui 710 and clippy are green. #1507 is P3. Screenshots are local, to be attached by the user. Flagged ready; a review by the other session is next.",
